{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-61348","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91083","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-61349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91084","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-91085","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-91086","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-91087","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-91088","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-91089","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-61350","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91090","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-61351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91091","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-91092","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-91093","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-61352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91094","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-91095","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-61353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91096","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-91097","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-91098","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-61354","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-61355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91099","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-91100","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-91101","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-61356","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91102","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-61357","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-61358","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91103","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-61359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91104","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-91105","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-91106","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-61360","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-61361","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91107","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-61362","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91108","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-61363","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91109","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-91110","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView"}]}],"id":"blk-61364","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61367","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91111","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-91112","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]}],"id":"blk-61366","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61368","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91113","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-91114","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-61369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91115","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-91116","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-61371","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91117","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-91118","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-61373","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91119","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-91120","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-61375","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91121","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-61377","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61379","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91122","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-91123","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91124","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-91125","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61380","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-61382","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61384","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91126","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-61383","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91127","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-61385","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61388","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91128","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-61387","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61389","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91129","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]}],"id":"blk-61390","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-61392","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91130","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-91131","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-61393","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91132","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-91133","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-61395","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91134","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-91135","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-61397","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91136","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-91137","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-61399","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61401","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91138","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-61402","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91139","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-91140","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91141","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-91142","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61403","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61405","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91143","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-61406","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91144","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-91145","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-61408","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91146","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-61410","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61412","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91147","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-91148","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-91149","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-91150","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-61413","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-61415","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91151","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-61416","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61419","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91152","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-61418","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91153","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-61420","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91154","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-61422","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91155","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-61424","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61427","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91156","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-61426","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61428","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91157","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-91158","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],"id":"blk-61429","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-61431","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91159","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-61432","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91160","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-91161","text":" (section 8)"}]}],"id":"blk-61433","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61435","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91162","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-61436","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61439","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91163","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-61438","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91164","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-91165","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-61440","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91166","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-61442","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61444","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91167","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-61445","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91168","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-91169","text":" (section 6)"}]}],"id":"blk-61446","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61448","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91170","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-61449","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91171","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-61451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91172","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-61453","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61455","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91173","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-91174","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes"}]}],"id":"blk-61456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91175","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-91176","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]}],"id":"blk-61458","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-61460","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-91177","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-61461","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91178","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-91179","text":" (section 7)"}]}],"id":"blk-61462","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-61464","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-91180","text":"Permission r